flowchart TB
  Task[Task Workflow Skill authorization]
  Sandbox[Codex sandbox]
  Guardian[Guardian / approval decision]
  Direct[Direct capability\nsource read, python3, Git read, /tmp Git]
  Approved[Approved capability\nuv cache, formal Git metadata, gh/network, reversible ref]
  Manual[Maintainer-only\nMerge, lifecycle close, protection bypass]
  Runner[Future Validation / Evidence Runner]

  Task --> Sandbox
  Sandbox --> Direct
  Sandbox -->|blocked or policy-routed| Guardian
  Guardian -->|approved with exact scope| Approved
  Guardian -->|not delegated| Manual
  Runner -. command orchestration and evidence .-> Sandbox
  Runner -. does not grant permission .-> Guardian
